{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master precision platforming in Memori, where every death teaches you something new. Navigate challenging puzzles, uncover secrets, and perfect your runs in a world built for speedrunners and puzzle solvers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712700/extras/Memori_Chapter_5_portals.gif?t=1750277250\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712700/extras/Memori_Chapter_2_fireboxes_and_portals.gif?t=1750277250\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level presents intricate platforming challenges that demand both skill and strategy. Learn the mechanics, master the movement, and discover new ways to approach each obstacle as you progress through mysterious environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712700/extras/Memori_Chapter_3_blocks.gif?t=1750277250\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built with speedrunners in mind, Memori features responsive controls and tight mechanics designed for competitive play. Chase personal bests, climb leaderboards, and share your achievements with the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712700/extras/Memori_Chapter_3_boss.gif?t=1750277250\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an Early Access title, you can actively shape Memori's development. Share feedback, suggest improvements, and help build the precision platformer you want to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712700/extras/Memori_Chapter_4_portals.gif?t=1750277250\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Precision controls optimized for competitive play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging platforming puzzles with multiple solutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speedrunning mode with integrated timing and leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secrets and hidden mechanics to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Responsive community-driven development</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean, focused visual design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">cats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712700/extras/2025-06-1611-58-35-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1750277250\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1712700?t=1750277250","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712700/7f11117708ffa39457509fad81542c35d4c011d5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750277250","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712700/f64b10ad8c52b51bb2147855ab2380c3b84f7918/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750277250","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712700/f64b10ad8c52b51bb2147855ab2380c3b84f7918/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750277250","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master precision platforming in Memori, where every death teaches you some